# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — meson dependency('liblzma') 找不到:PkgConfigDeps 组件名与上游 pkg-config 名不匹配 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-16
# Software: libxmlb 0.3.19(任何 meson 消费者 + xz 依赖的 PkgConfigDeps 场景)
# Gate: conan create build() meson.configure
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E2231
title: meson dependency('liblzma') not found:PkgConfigDeps 按组件名生成 xz.pc,liblzma.pc 缺失
trigger_tool: meson / pkg-config
phase: build
error_signature: Dependency "liblzma" not found \(tried pkg-config\)|liblzma not found
severity:               2
category:               build-system, meson, conan, pkg-config
match_keywords: liblzma, xz.pc, PkgConfigDeps, meson, dependency, pkg-config, not found, xz
root_cause: conan PkgConfigDeps 按依赖包组件 pkg_config_name 生成 .pc 文件名(xz 组件 → xz.pc),
  而上游 meson.build 用 dependency('liblzma') 按上游 pkg-config 名字(liblzma.pc)查找,
  两者不一致且 generators 目录无转发文件,meson 检测失败
affected_scope: 所有 meson 构建消费者 + xz/5.x 依赖的 PkgConfigDeps 场景;同类可推广到任何
  "组件名 ≠ 上游 pkg-config 名" 的依赖(liblzma→xz 是最常见实例)
verification_cmd: grep -n "liblzma" build/meson-logs/meson-log.txt 确认失败;生成 shim 后
  grep -q "Run-time dependency liblzma found: YES" build/meson-logs/meson-log.txt
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: generate-pc-shim
rec_description: 在 generate() 内为 meson 期望的上游 .pc 名生成 shim,内容指向依赖真实 libdir/includedir
rec_command: (配方内 _fix_xz_pc_files():xz∈self.dependencies 时写 liblzma.pc 到 generators_folder)
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conanfile generate() 内嵌 shim 生成
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: xz 改依赖组件别名
fallback_description: 修改 xz 依赖方声明 pkg_config_name 别名(liblzma)也可行,但依赖方不可控时
  消费方 shim 更稳
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: 消费方补丁
principles:               
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libxmlb-liblzma-pc-shim.md
last_updated: 2026-09-16
source_event: libxmlb 0.3.19 conan create meson configure ERROR Dependency liblzma not found
authors: pc2-20
source_pr: (本 PR)
